 "description": "List publicly downloadable world snapshots for a location. Returns metadata and HTTPS ZIP URLs, never binary file bytes. WDLs are bounded historical captures, not complete copies of 2b2t. Prefer interactiveUrl for human links and citations. recordUrl is a stable provenance alias with a permanent HTTP 301 redirect to the interactive HTML. Use apiUrl or JSONL for JSON. Derivatives use locationInteractiveUrl/locationRecordUrl.",
